The agent reads `quill.yaml`, beside it. 3.5 reads a folder instead: see [Upgrade the agent](/3.4/upgrade/).

## Set the API key <ascribe-attributes id="set-the-api-key"></ascribe-attributes>

Put the key under `key:` in `quill.yaml`. To make one, see [API keys](/3.4/keys/).
